# Reviewed AI-only additions shared by BOTH Shadowrocket AI and v2rayN.
# Format SERVICE,DOMAIN,EXACT-HOST. Never add whole Google APIs/CDN/analytics suffixes.
# Gemini: an official firewall ALLOWLIST is not an AI-only proxy list.
# Shared Google login/CDN/Fonts/Play/People/OAuth hosts are intentionally excluded;
# those requests fall through to the original Johnshall rules.
# Shared Google Search/assistant helpers are intentionally NOT routed as AI-only.
# Official reference: https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/generative-ai/gemini-app/gemini-app-firewall-settings
# Verified product-specific API, Web, updates and enterprise Notebook entrances.
# Do not widen to googleapis.com, run.app, cloud.google.com or all Google Cloud AI.
GEMINI,DOMAIN,antigravity.google.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,antigravity-cli-auto-updater-974169037036.us-central1.run.app
GEMINI,DOMAIN,antigravity-hub-auto-updater-974169037036.us-central1.run.app
GEMINI,DOMAIN,jules.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,businessaicode.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,businessaicode.us.rep.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,businessaicode.eu.rep.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,businessaicode.mtls.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,notebooklm.cloud.google.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,notebook.cloud.google.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,notebooklm.cloud.google
GEMINI,DOMAIN,notebook.cloud.google
GEMINI,DOMAIN,ai.google
GEMINI,DOMAIN,ai.google.com
# Core Gemini product entrances already present in both reviewed feeds.
# Pin the SAME existing match types; do not add generic Google login/CDN scopes.
# https://aistudio.google.com/docs/get-started
# https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/generative-ai/gemini-app/gemini-app-firewall-settings
# https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini/docs/codeassist/set-up-gemini
GEMINI,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ai.studio
GEMINI,DOMAIN,cloudaicompanion.googleapis.com
GEMINI,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com
# Shared Google login/Cloud APIs continue to follow the baseline geographic routes.
# Reference: https://cloud.google.com/gemini/docs/codeassist/set-up-gemini
# Claude Code network requirements; core anthropic.com/claude.ai covered by suffix.
# Exact optional error reporting: never route the generic datadoghq.com suffix.
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/network-config
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,api.anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,platform.claude.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,mcp-proxy.anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,downloads.claude.ai
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,assets-proxy.anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,bridge.claudeusercontent.com
# Claude Code optional error reports, Anthropic-documented exact host only.
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com
# Pinned Claude routing baseline independent of community-feed changes.
# These do not authorize broad shared CDN, Datadog or Sentry suffixes.
CLAUDE,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
CLAUDE,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
CLAUDE,DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com
# Anthropic documents this as OPTIONAL telemetry; pinned only to retain the chosen route.
CLAUDE,DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com
